<title>UK: Bermuda's Starr Excess names new vp, underwriting.</title>
<headline>Bermuda's Starr Excess names new vp, underwriting.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kevin P. Gadbois was appointed vice president, underwriting at Starr Excess, Hamilton, Bermuda, the company said.</p>
<p>Most recently, Gadbois was assistant vice president of the executive liability division at Great American Insurance Cos, Cincinnati.</p>
<p>- Reuters Insurance News - +44 171 542 2770</p>
